    "message": "Diagnose service capacity on the shared generated Scenario\n\nThe diagnostic tests built their own Scenarios with InitialScenarioBuilder\n(seed 7, one day) for 10, 30 or 100 evacuees. They now use the shared\ngenerated_scenario, or generated_scenario_with(evacuees=N) where the\nchecked numbers depend on the count (#88).\n\nThe test that a floor-plan station counts as one unit now compares with\nthe Scenario's water stations instead of the fixed 2 that 30 evacuees\ngave. The check of the generator's own defaults across sizes keeps\nbuilding drafts directly. The CLI test moves to\ntests/integration/test_service_capacity_cli.py.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
